  titleKey: A Registered Irregularity
  narrativeTextKey: "A grey sedan idles at the access road. Two clerks. The senior
    \u2014 registration 1148 \u2014 presents a folder listing this bunker's nominal
    coordinates, dated last week, and requests a voluntary supplementary registration
    of all personnel currently residing in the area. He does not raise his voice.
    He writes."
